    mischievous: { pos: "adj.", zh: "淘氣調皮的；惡作劇的", level: 2, diff: 55, ex: "The mischievous child hid his sister’s shoes as a joke.", exZh: "那個淘氣的孩子為了開玩笑，把姊姊的鞋子藏了起來。" },
