    misnomer: { pos: "n.", zh: "使用不當的名字（或名稱）；名字（或名稱）的誤用", level: 3, diff: 75, ex: "Calling this region a desert is a misnomer because it receives heavy rainfall.", exZh: "把這個地區稱為沙漠並不恰當，因為這裡降雨量很大。" },
