    monsieur: { pos: "n.", zh: "先生；大親王（十六世紀以後法國國王的次子或大弟的稱號）", level: 3, diff: 85, ex: "In sixteenth-century France, monsieur could be the title of the king’s younger brother.", exZh: "在十六世紀的法國，monsieur 可以是國王弟弟的稱號。" },
