    transatlantic: { pos: "adj.", zh: "橫渡大西洋的；大西洋彼岸的", level: 2, diff: 60, ex: "They took a transatlantic flight from New York to London.", exZh: "他們搭乘橫渡大西洋的班機，從紐約飛往倫敦。" },
