    truculence: { pos: "n.", zh: "野蠻；殘酷；刻薄，粗暴", level: 3, diff: 85, ex: "The referee warned the player about his truculence toward the opposing team.", exZh: "裁判警告那名球員不要對敵隊表現得如此粗暴。" },
